{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"15243","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/15243","key":"MC-191669","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"24/Jun/20 12:46 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>If change your gamemode to spectator while running into an obstruction, your sprint will be disabled.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"StepstoReproduce%3A\"></a>Steps to Reproduce:</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Run towards a wall in Creative or Survival mode (continue doing this)</li>\n\t<li>Press F3 + N to change gamemode</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Observed%26ExpectedResults\"></a>Observed &amp; Expected Results</h3>\n<p><img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> - You will not be sprinting when entering spectator mode, and will not be able to sprint at all until changing your gamemode again.<br>\n<img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/check.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> - Your sprint would continue when changing gamemodes, and not be disabled.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Video\"></a>Video</h3>\n<p><sup>(Since my key presses are not shown, I am sprinting into the wall, switching game modes, then sprinting again in spectator)</sup><br>\n <span class=\"nobr\"><a href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/24388\" title=\"SpectatorSprint.mp4 attached to MC-191669\" data-attachment-type=\"file\" data-attachment-name=\"SpectatorSprint.mp4\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" data-media-services-id=\"3bde2927-04a3-45ff-b478-239a1158c997\" rel=\"noreferrer\">SpectatorSprint.mp4<sup><img class=\"rendericon\" src=\"/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></sup></a></span> </p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Notes\"></a>Notes</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Related to other sprinting issues:<br>\n\n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-133414\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-133414\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Sprinting in shallow water is no longer possible\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-133414\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-68453\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-68453\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"You cannot fly and sprint simultaneously in creative mode when double-tapping the &quot;Walk Forwards&quot; key\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-68453\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro\" data-jira-key=\"MC-190768\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-190768\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"The player cannot enter swim-mode when they have the blindness status effect applied\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-190768\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-complete jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Open</span>\n            </span>\n \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro\" data-jira-key=\"MC-4098\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-4098\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Sprinting sometimes causes FOV to toggle while walking at normal speed\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-4098\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-complete jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Reopened</span>\n            </span>\n</li>\n\t<li>The player can fix this themselves by changing their gamemode off spectator, and then changing back.</li>\n\t<li>This only works for changing gamemode with F3 + N, not by using the gamemode switcher with F3 + F4.</li>\n</ol>\n","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"24/Jun/20 8:43 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/510800","id":"510800","filename":"5.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"Benats","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Moscow","accountType":"customer"},"created":"17/Jun/25 4:01 PM","size":"10.01 MB","mimeType":"video/mp4","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/510800"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/24388","id":"24